{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_clour_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_clour_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "安身之處",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_clour_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "33b23f1d4abdeef9d828c31216af3bd96235fc8867de5e5104267edd66412c45",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "11:00 A.M. 天氣/晴朗\n羅德島宿舍"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "厚重的真皮毛氈嚴實地遮住窗戶，一簇燭火堪堪將房間照亮。\n矮小的沃爾珀少女張弓搭箭，警惕地注視著前方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……是終端在響。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "真吵……是這麼用的吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喂？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "紅雲……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咦，哪去了……抱歉紅雲，稍等一下哦。奇怪，明明放進工具箱裡了的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喔！在這裡！怎麼被塞到配件盒裡了。久等了——芙蓉？怎麼是你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "安德切爾，你看見紅雲了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我還想問你呢，紅雲剛剛還在這裡的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我為她調整了義肢，想給她拿一份甜品來著。不過一會的工夫，她就不見了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "安德切爾，你知道她接下來可能會去什麼地方嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我沒問。最近她不是在休假嗎，去哪裡都有可能吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "芙蓉，你看起來很慌張……難道紅雲出什麼事了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "紅雲……今天是她定期接受礦石病治療的日子，但是下午她沒來醫療部，而且取消了所有治療預約。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "得知消息以後我找到她的宿舍，發現她不在裡面，房間裡似乎少了不少東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我問了一圈，誰都不知道她去哪裡了，有見到她的人說她在悶頭走……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不會吧，她來我這裡時，也沒表現得特別奇怪。不過說起來，的確有個不太尋常的舉動……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就是在調整完之後，她突然不由分說地塞給我一份禮物。以前她不會這樣的，對吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她給了你什麼，能給我看看嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喏，就是這個。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "獸牙吊飾……"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "對了芙蓉，既然你都來了，要不要嚐嚐我做的甜品——\n欸，別急著走啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "抱歉！下次一定！我得先去找紅雲問個明白！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "莉娜，你的黑眼圈好嚴重哦。最近沒有休息好嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒事啦，就是前段時間加班比較多。你知道這段時間做完外勤任務回來的幹員很多嘛，醫療部這邊就一下子忙起來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不過這也正常啦，很多前輩比我們加班更嚴重，忙過這陣就清閒多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（停步）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "醫療部的工作是這樣啦，緊一陣鬆一陣的。不用擔心，我馬上就回去補覺——哇啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "紅雲？你什麼時候在這裡的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你拖著這麼多東西是要去哪裡呀？回家嗎？還是去多索雷斯度假？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我不回家……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "請問你們知道羅德島上哪裡有藥草嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊，你有哪裡不舒服嗎？我可以先幫你檢查一下，或者我陪你去醫療部……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒有，我只是想知道哪裡有藥草。你們知道嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "說起藥草，聽說萊娜小姐在療養庭院裡栽種了各種各樣的花草，也許其中有一些會有藥用價值……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "謝謝，我現在就去找她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哦，這個給你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "拋光的骨片……給我這個做什麼呀？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯？人呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "來啦來啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "波登可，這麼晚就不用拿訂單過來……咦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "萊娜……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小紅雲……啊，請進。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "抱歉，因為平時你都在出外勤，我沒怎麼在休息區域見過你，突然見到你來找我，實在有些意外……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有什麼我可以幫到你的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我想要幾種藥草，你這裡有嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你是想要有藥用價值的植物嗎？當然可以，告訴我名字就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……我不知道它們的名字，但見到它們，我就能認出來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔，那你隨我來庭院看看吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有見到你要的植物嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這個，這個，還有那個開紅色小花的草。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（都是一些有舒緩安神功效的花卉……）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還要別的嗎……嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你這裡有那種……葉子上有很多小疙瘩的草嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "葉子上有很多小疙瘩的草？哦，是說石麻草嗎？它有調節情緒的作用，我就在庭院種了一些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "脖子割破了，把它們嚼碎塞進傷口裡，就不會感覺到痛了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "欸……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那種藤韌性很好，可以絞斷骨頭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……小紅雲，先不說這個，你還需要別的植物嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "夠了，不用了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "給你，都裝在盒子裡啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "謝謝你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這些藥草很有價值，我得想想要用什麼和你換。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "換？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "弓不能給你，手也不能給你……我身上其他有價值的東西，只剩這柄匕首了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "給你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不用啦，你拿去就好，這不過是一些花花草草，在庭院裡還有不少呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不行。一份獵物換一份報酬，一趟出差換一頓晚飯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一把匕首……換萊娜的藥草。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小紅雲，我不需要你這麼做。發生了什麼嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是匕首不夠嗎？那我再找找還有什麼可以給你……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我不是這個意思，這是一柄很好的匕首……呃，我想，也許平時在園藝中也用得到……唉，我會收下匕首的，好嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是聽好了，之後你千萬不要再給別人塞東西了呀！絕對不要了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "藥草我帶走了，謝謝你……再見，萊娜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等等，小紅雲。我有一個問題，你……拿這些植物是要做什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "萊娜，我還不想離開。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這就是事情的全部經過……等我追出門去的時候，她已經走得沒影了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "多謝……呼，看來得去其他地方找找了。假如接下來是要處理藥草的話，實驗室可能會是她的去處……我現在就去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "芙蓉，小紅雲話裡的意思……她是要離開羅德島了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "人事部沒有收到她離職的申請。她在外勤任務中的表現也很出色，不可能過不了試用期。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "總之……她的情況我也是一頭霧水。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我更擔心的是，送葬人先生帶她回來的時候，是不是交代過，她家……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "萊娜，你放心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不管是什麼促使她做出了任何決定，在從她口中得到真相前，我不會讓她離開。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "現在不能進去了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "後勤幹員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "抱歉，現在後廚已經關門了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "廚具，哪裡還有廚具……似乎在誰的辦公室見過泡麵碗……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "後勤幹員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "請留步。看你的樣子，你是要出外勤嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "後勤幹員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "天啊，餓著肚子一定不方便趕路吧……我屋子裡還有一些乾糧和沙蟲乾，我這就去給你拿來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "後勤幹員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可以麻煩你幫我在這裡看著嗎？由於時常有人半夜闖入食堂後廚，我被派來負責今晚的保安工作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "後勤幹員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "拜託了！我很快就回來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "原來後廚是可以進去的，明白了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好結實的鐵門，這是……防護網嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就像為阻擋兇惡野獸而設計的，不愧是羅德島。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒有工作人員的識別證就進不去，有別的辦法嗎……嗯，這下面有隱蔽鎖孔，應該能撬開。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可……我的匕首，交給萊娜了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "♪哼……哼哼……哼……♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……嗯？不是酒吧，這裡是……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……聽歌聽得太入迷了，竟然走到食堂來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "必須趕緊回去，不然會錯過酒吧關門前最後的炸鱗薯條供應……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "什麼人——嗯？紅雲？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "噓……霜葉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "紅雲，你來這裡幹什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（咕——）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你有帶刀嗎？能不能借我用一下？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯，給你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "謝謝，現在我身上沒有什麼有價值的東西了。我會想辦法給你回報的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃，你在做什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "切斷這裡的電線。然後只要把刀插入鎖孔裡……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你是從哪裡學到這些技巧的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "烏薩斯的傭兵駐地，多試幾次就會了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……不對！你是在撬後廚的門嗎？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是的，因為廚具放在裡面……我得進去拿到它們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你得趕快停下，要是被人看到，會把你當成小偷的……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "說起來，食堂平時的後勤同事怎麼都不在？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "找到鎖芯了，接下來只要這樣……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好了，門開了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "後勤幹員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我回來啦——紅雲？你在哪裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "工作人員回來了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "紅雲，快離開這裡——你怎麼進去了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一口鍋找到了，第二口鍋……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "後勤幹員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯？有人在後廚嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘖，麻煩了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "再拿塊獸肉好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "紅雲！快走！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呼，呼……沒人追上來吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒有……霜葉，你扛著肉跑得很快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我不認為這是什麼值得驕傲的事……等等！你又在做什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "生火。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在這裡真的可以生火嗎？不會觸發警報嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不會，我經常來這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……總之，我得走了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "酒吧已經關門了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我拿了兩口鍋。這口，煮藥草。那口，做燉肉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "燉肉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你幫了我，燉肉給你作回報，夠不夠？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "回報？我那根本不算幫你，而且……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "交換，這是規矩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……以前在哥倫比亞我見過一些荒野居民的聚落，聚落的獵人們拿自己狩獵到的獵物向族人換取生活用品。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他們恪守著這樣的規矩，而後走進荒野，日復一日。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "很熟悉，就像我過去的生活……在很久以前，在我被人帶上羅德島之前，是比那之前更久的日子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你是被人帶來羅德島的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他說是為了給我治病，我的醫療帳單已經付清了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他看起來並不像壞人，但……也和好不沾邊。我不相信他，世上不該有這樣的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你可以和博士談談，博士是個好人。看起來也像。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我說過了，就是那個什麼，博士。我說，我不需要他們和我分享任何東西。我為他們工作，以換得我在這裡的一切。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "博士什麼都沒說，應該是默認了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……羅德島不是這樣的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你不用騙我，我去過荒野之外的地方，烏薩斯人的營地、外面的聚落。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那裡的確不用獵物來換東西，但是會用一些閃亮亮的金屬片代替親手取來的收獲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "到哪裡都是一樣，我看得夠多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊，水開了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "把水倒進肉裡……剩下的水煮藥草，蓋上蓋子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這樣就好了，再等一會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "沃爾珀少女習慣性地在牆面上蹭了蹭手，然後在平台的邊緣蹲下。她怔怔地望向外面。\n羅德島正在大地上行駛著，強烈的射燈光芒下，能清晰地看見沿途的碎石被碾為粉末。\n一陣風掠過荒野，隨後連微塵也無影無蹤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在這裡坐著……不會有人來打擾，可以坐很久。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "羅德島是個好地方，好的外面聚落。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但不是我的聚落……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "霜葉望著前方那矮小的背影，輕輕地嘆了口氣。\n突然，她快步走向那個背影，同時將耳機靠近紅雲。\n下一瞬間，樂聲在紅雲的耳畔流淌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "♪無需你的給予，無需你的許諾♪\n♪就在一成不變的太陽下♪\n♪牽起我的手，踏上旅途♪\n♪直到地平線的那頭♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這首歌……讓我想起從前和族人在一起的時候，吃飯前分餐具，大家邊拍桌子邊唱的歌……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "謝謝你分享給我，我會想辦法……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "歌聲的價值是沒辦法衡量的，也就不能用來交換。這樣的事……還有很多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這樣嗎……如果沒能留下來，在離開的路上，我會好好想想你的話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "離開？你要走了？去哪裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我不能待在羅德島了，他們不允許……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他們？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯。天快要亮了。我得趕快去做最後一次努力……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好煩，因為熬了太多的夜，晚上反而睡不著了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……怎麼走廊上會有燒木柴的味道……嘶，好香……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那是紅雲嗎……還有霜葉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們被發現了。紅雲？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "紅……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不見了……鍋也是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等等——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "真是的，那孩子到底跑到什麼地方去了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "跑到食堂以後就不見了，到處都找不見她……前半夜的食堂後廚入侵事件不會和她有關係吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不對，能和這種事扯上關係的人也太多了，怎麼都算不到紅雲頭上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊，肚子好餓……光顧著找人，竟然忘記吃晚飯了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "辦公室裡嘉維爾藏起來的吃的是不是還剩一些，雖然不那麼健康但……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只吃裡面的蔬菜應該……還好？總要有力氣找人嘛。嘉維爾一定不會介意的，嗯，大概……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（從辦公室那邊傳來的聲音？有人在加班嗎……）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你好，有人在辦公室嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "芙蓉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "紅雲！你竟然在這裡！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "芙蓉，你在加班嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你去哪裡了？我一直在找你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你為什麼取消今天的治療？你說你要離開羅德島又是怎麼回事？你身上的礦石病只是暫時抑制住了，離好轉還差得遠呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我告訴你，你要是不能交代清楚，就別想從我眼前溜走！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不會是……有什麼壞人欺負你了吧？不要怕，你告訴我，我會要他好看！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "醫生，我有東西要給你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "東西？給我的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "給——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（這口鍋……像在食堂見過……）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我要揭開鍋蓋嗎？裡面是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他們說最近醫療部的工作很忙，你肯定沒有睡好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "以前我追獵物的時候，也有好幾天都睡不了覺。有幾種藥草放在一起煮成的湯，喝下去以後會很舒服。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我給你煮了一份，你喝下去，如果感覺到舒服一些，就代表我能幫到你了。這件事我可以一直做下去……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那我是不是就……還可以留在羅德島上接受治療……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（揭開蓋子）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哇……好香。是燉肉嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不是這個！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊，一定、一定是我把鍋拿錯了！芙蓉，我現在就去換回來！等等我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等一下……你是在這裡專門等著我嗎？等著把這個東西給我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "難道你今天消失一天是為了這個？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可這不是我想給你的東西……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "對不起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可你為什麼說要給我那個……草藥湯，你才能接受治療呀？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "因為我的工作沒有了。我想要留在這裡，繼續接受治療，就要找到新的工作。我會做的事不多……只有這個。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你在說什麼呀？我專門向人事部確認過，你通過試用期的審核馬上就要下來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可是昨天早上有人事部的人聯繫我，說我不用參加外勤任務了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "然後我在終端上看到，我今天的、明天的，還有下個星期的外勤申請都被取消了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他們不允許我留在這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……紅雲，你完全理解錯了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "理解……錯了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "人事部會取消你的外勤申請……是因為現在是你的假期。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你自入職以來連續出了太多的外勤任務！我擔心你的身體負荷太重，讓醫療部特別為你申請了假期。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "假期時間，正是從昨天早上開始！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "假期……意思是我不用工作，也可以就這樣接受治療嗎……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你好傻哦。你出了那麼多外勤任務，為大家做了那麼多事情，還不算是我們中的一員嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我是你們中的一員……你是這麼想的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "當然呀，所以在這裡你完全不用計較要還給每個人多少東西，沒人會計較這個。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "現在是你的假期，你可以憑你自己的心意，做任何你想做的事。而我們，肯定也會一如既往地支持你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "羅德島是你可以安心待著的地方，它正是為此而存在的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你聽清楚了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不明白也沒關係！總之真相搞清楚了，呼，一下子就感覺輕鬆多了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊燉肉！快，找個地方把鍋放下！既然是你給我做的，嚐幾塊應該也不要緊……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
